Goal

Exploit transient triangular arbitrage opportunities on a single exchange with two base currencies (INR, USDT) across ~300 common symbols with minimal latency, built-in risk controls, and auditable P&L.

Users

You (operator/trader), infra engineer, future PM.

No end-customer UI initially; operator dashboard only.

Success metrics (North Star + guardrails)

Net daily P&L > 0 with Sharpe > 1.0 over rolling 30d.

Fill hit rate ≥ 65% on signaled triangles (tuned by symbol).

Median decision latency (tick → decision) ≤ 4ms on-box.

Order acks ≤ 80ms p99 (Mumbai region placement).

Abort rate (leg-2/3 hedges) ≤ 10% of total runs.

Out of scope (MVP)

Cross-exchange inventory rebalancing.

Margin/derivatives; only spot.

